  "text": "Gold Price in the 1970s\nBetween the first (1970-01-30) and last (1979-12-28) monthly observations available for the 1970s, the LBMA gold price went from $34.99 to $512 — a gain of 1363% — with a sampled high of $512 (Dec 1979) and a sampled low of $34.99 (Jan 1970).\nYears in the 1970s\n1970\n1971\n1972\n1973\n1974\n1975\n1976\n1977\n1978\n1979\nSee today's live gold price on the\nspot dashboard\n, or\nshop gold bullion\nat Bullion Trading LLC.\nData retrieved 2026-09-26. Latest observation for this metal: 2026-09-25. The current month is provisional.\nSources, sampling and calculation methodology\n.\nPrepared by the\nBullion Trading LLC editorial team\n.",
